 "subs": [
  {
   "id": "l01_0",
   "line": "l01",
   "text": "In 1324, a king walked into Cairo, and broke its economy.",
   "t0": 0.35,
   "t1": 5.75
  },
  {
   "id": "l02_1",
   "line": "l02",
   "text": "Not with an army. With gifts.",
   "t0": 6.25,
   "t1": 8.57
  },
  {
   "id": "l03_2",
   "line": "l03",
   "text": "His name was Mansa Musa, ruler of the Mali Empire, often called the richest man who ever lived.",
   "t0": 9.45,
   "t1": 16.87
  },
  {
   "id": "l04_3",
   "line": "l04",
   "text": "His kingdom was rich in gold, at a time when the whole world ran on it.",
   "t0": 17.45,
   "t1": 22.83
  },
  {
   "id": "l05_4",
   "line": "l05",
   "text": "That year, he set out for Mecca, across the Sahara.",
   "t0": 23.45,
   "t1": 27.01
  },
  {
   "id": "l06_5",
   "line": "l06",
   "text": "By some accounts, tens of thousands of people travelled with him, and camels loaded with gold.",
   "t0": 27.75,
   "t1": 34.09
  },
  {
   "id": "l07_6",
   "line": "l07",
   "text": "When he reached Cairo, he gave it away. To officials.",
   "t0": 35.05,
   "t1": 38.11
  },
  {
   "id": "l07_7",
   "line": "l07",
   "text": "To merchants. To the poor in the streets.",
   "t0": 38.15,
   "t1": 41.29
  },
  {
   "id": "l08_8",
   "line": "l08",
   "text": "And then, something strange happened.",
   "t0": 42.25,
   "t1": 44.87
  },
  {
   "id": "l09_9",
   "line": "l09",
   "text": "There was so much gold in Cairo, that gold itself became cheap.",
   "t0": 45.85,
   "t1": 50.33
  },
  {
   "id": "l10_10",
   "line": "l10",
   "text": "Its value fell.",
   "t0": 50.85,
   "t1": 52.19
  },
  {
   "id": "l10_11",
   "line": "l10",
   "text": "And according to one historian, 12 years later, it still hadn't recovered.",
   "t0": 52.23,
   "t1": 57.23
  },
  {
   "id": "l11_12",
   "line": "l11",
   "text": "One man's generosity shook one of the richest cities on Earth.",
   "t0": 57.95,
   "t1": 62.67
  },
  {
   "id": "l12_13",
   "line": "l12",
   "text": "But it also put Mali on the map. Literally.",
   "t0": 63.45,
   "t1": 66.73
  },
  {
   "id": "l13_14",
   "line": "l13",
   "text": "50 years later, a famous map of the world showed him on a throne, holding a nugget of gold.",
   "t0": 67.45,
   "t1": 74.07
  },
  {
   "id": "l14_15",
   "line": "l14",
   "text": "Most people are remembered for what they kept.",
   "t0": 75.05,
   "t1": 77.95
  },
  {
   "id": "l14_16",
   "line": "l14",
   "text": "He was remembered for what he gave away.",
   "t0": 78.09,
   "t1": 80.51
  }
 ],
